jobs.content:
&lt;h1 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Principal Solution Consultant – Enterprise DevOps &amp;amp; ADM Transformation&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; [Hampshire, UK / Hybrid / Remote - UK &amp;amp; EMEA]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Job Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Executive / Principal Level (15+ Years)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional Services / Solutions Architecture &amp;amp; Consulting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-102&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0&quot;&gt;We are seeking an articulate, persuasive, and seasoned &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;55&quot;&gt;Principal Solution Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; to lead large-scale Application Delivery Management (ADM) and DevOps transformation initiatives across EMEA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2&quot;&gt;. Sitting at the intersection of pre-sales, solution architecture, and organizational management of change, you will partner with C-level stakeholders, IT directors, and enterprise clients to define and deliver modern IT target operating models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-103&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0&quot;&gt;In this role, you will lead complex Go-to-Market (GTM) strategies, convert high-value leads into delivery orders, and commodify bespoke transformation techniques into standardized enterprise offerings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2&quot;&gt;. If you have a proven track record of guiding global organizations through enterprise Agile (SAFe), Service Integration and Management (SIAM), and end-to-end DevOps model office implementation, we want to hear from you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;Strategy, Pre-Sales &amp;amp; GTM Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-104&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Go-To-Market Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Define, implement, and drive GTM strategies across EMEA, collaborating closely with Sales and Pre-Sales teams to build pipeline and drive revenue growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-105&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Value &amp;amp; Solution Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with sales leadership on cross-sell and up-sell opportunities, conducting solution discovery workshops with client IT, test, delivery, and operations directors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-106&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Service Commodification:&lt;/strong&gt; Transform bespoke consulting delivery methods, practices, and prototyping techniques into scalable, standardized enterprise service offerings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;DevOps, ADM &amp;amp; Architecture Solutions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-107&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Transformation Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect end-to-end DevOps, Continuous Integration/Continuous Deployment (CI/CD), and automated testing roadmaps aligned with frameworks like SAFe, TOGAF, and ITIL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-108&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Sand-Pit &amp;amp; Model Office Prototyping:&lt;/strong&gt; Initiate and manage complex product integrations (e.g., ADM suites, cloud platforms, microservices) into DevOps Model Office capabilities for client demonstrations and proof-of-concept testing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-109&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Service Integration (SIAM):&lt;/strong&gt; Provide architectural governance and target operating models for multi-vendor, complex IT ecosystems, service automation, and IaaS/PaaS environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;Client Engagement &amp;amp; Management of Change&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-110&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Build trust-based relationships with senior stakeholders, executive sponsors, and technical teams to gain buy-in for major organizational and digital changes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-111&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Design Assurance &amp;amp; Risk Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish design assurance processes and conduct product/vendor evaluations to mitigate delivery risks and unlock operational cost savings for clients&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-112&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;17,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;17,2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Practice Alignment &amp;amp; Mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, integrate, and mentor cross-functional consulting teams across global sub-regions, establishing best practices for project delivery and team capabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;17,2,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;17,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-113&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;21,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,0,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Industry Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive background in IT, Telecommunications, or enterprise Professional Services, managing large global programs or critical national infrastructure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-114&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;21,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep hands-on and strategic knowledge of Application Delivery Management (ADM), enterprise DevOps, Continuous Integration/Delivery pipelines, and Service Integration &amp;amp; Management (SIAM)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-115&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;21,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Pre-Sales Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to support sales cycles, shape high-value bids/RFPs, expand pipeline, and turn client opportunities into realized delivery orders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,2,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-116&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;21,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Frameworks &amp;amp; Methodologies:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience adapting Scaled Agile Framework (SAFe), ITIL, and Enterprise Architecture frameworks (TOGAF, MODAF, UML, SOA) in complex enterprise environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,3,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-117&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;21,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,4,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Organizational Change:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability in Applied Management of Change—guiding client teams from legacy monolithic structures to modern, automated IT operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,4,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-118&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;21,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional presentation, communication, and workshop facilitation skills with executive-level stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,5,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;21,5,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;Preferred Certifications &amp;amp; Education&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;23&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-119&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;23,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;23,0,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;TOGAF 9 Certification&lt;/strong&gt; (or equivalent Enterprise Architecture credential)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;23,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;23,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-120&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;23,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;23,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;ITIL Foundation&lt;/strong&gt; / Advanced Service Delivery certification&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;23,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;23,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-121&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;23,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;23,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Scaled Agile Framework (SAFe) Practitioner / Agilist certification&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;23,2,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;23,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-122&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;23,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;23,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Strong track record across EMEA or global multi-national client portfolios&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;23,3,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;23,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;25&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;26&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;26,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;26,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Competitive Executive Package:&lt;/strong&gt; Attractive base salary + high-impact bonus structure tied to order realization and revenue pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;26,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;26,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid/Remote work options with flexible UK/EMEA travel flexibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;26,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;26,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct ownership over high-visibility enterprise transformations for Fortune 500/Global 2000 clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h1 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Job Title: Principal Solution Consultant – Enterprise DevOps &amp;amp; ADM Transformation&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; [Hampshire, UK / Hybrid / Remote - UK &amp;amp; EMEA]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Job Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Executive / Principal Level (15+ Years)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional Services / Solutions Architecture &amp;amp; Consulting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-102&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0&quot;&gt;We are seeking an articulate, persuasive, and seasoned &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;55&quot;&gt;Principal Solution Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; to lead large-scale Application Delivery Management (ADM) and DevOps transformation initiatives across EMEA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2&quot;&gt;. Sitting at the intersection of pre-sales, solution architecture, and organizational management of change, you will partner with C-level stakeholders, IT directors, and enterprise clients to define and deliver modern IT target operating models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_57fc7161dc7f4484-103&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0&quot;&gt;In this role, you will lead complex Go-to-Market (GTM) strategies, convert high-value leads into delivery orders, and commodify bespoke transformation techniques into standardized enterprise offerings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2&quot;&gt;. If you have a proven track record of guiding global organizations through enterprise Agile (SAFe), Service Integration and Management (SIAM), and end-to-end DevOps model office implementation, we want to hear from you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;Strategy, Pre-Sales &amp;amp; GTM Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
