&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Which technology &amp;amp; skills are important for us? &lt;/strong&gt;👌&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High / Good knowledge of Java and Spring, Hibernate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of development of Web Services REST/SOAP/XML/WSDL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of SQL / relational databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cloud solutions or willingness to learn (we will provide you with necessary trainings)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of Unix/Linux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of JIRA/Confluence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of Agile Software Development / Scrum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English - B2 level&lt;/li&gt;
