&lt;p&gt;# Technical Program Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;**Location:** [City, State / Remote / Hybrid]&lt;br&gt;**Employment Type:** Full-Time&lt;br&gt;**Department:** Engineering / Program Management&lt;br&gt;**Reports To:** Director of Engineering / VP of Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;## About the Role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Technical Program Manager to drive execution across complex, cross-functional engineering initiatives. You&#39;ll partner with engineering, product, and design leads to plan roadmaps, manage dependencies, remove blockers, and ensure programs ship on time and with high quality. This role requires enough technical depth to engage credibly with engineers on architecture and trade-offs, paired with strong program management fundamentals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;## Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Own end-to-end planning and execution of multi-team technical programs, from kickoff through launch&lt;br&gt;- Partner with engineering leads to define scope, milestones, and success criteria&lt;br&gt;- Identify, track, and drive resolution of cross-team dependencies and risks&lt;br&gt;- Build and maintain program plans, timelines, and status reporting for stakeholders and leadership&lt;br&gt;- Facilitate program-level rituals (planning, syncs, retros) without adding unnecessary process overhead&lt;br&gt;- Translate ambiguous technical problems into clear execution plans&lt;br&gt;- Surface trade-offs between scope, timeline, and resourcing to leadership with actionable recommendations&lt;br&gt;- Drive post-launch retrospectives and incorporate learnings into future planning&lt;br&gt;- Communicate program status, risks, and decisions clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;## Requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- 5+ years of experience in technical program management, engineering project management, or a related role&lt;br&gt;- Demonstrated ability to manage multiple concurrent cross-functional programs&lt;br&gt;- Strong technical fluency — able to read architecture diagrams, understand system dependencies, and hold your own in engineering discussions&lt;br&gt;- Experience with software development lifecycle and Agile/Scrum methodologies&lt;br&gt;- Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with experience presenting to senior leadership&lt;br&gt;- Proven track record of driving programs to on-time delivery in ambiguous or fast-changing environments&lt;br&gt;- Experience with project tracking tools (Jira, Asana, Linear, or similar)&lt;br&gt;- Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or related field, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;## Nice to Have&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Prior experience as a software engineer or in a hands-on technical role&lt;br&gt;- Experience with release management and CI/CD processes&lt;br&gt;- Familiarity with data-driven program tracking (dashboards, OKRs, metrics reporting)&lt;br&gt;- Experience managing programs involving third-party vendors or external partners&lt;br&gt;- PMP, PgMP, or Scrum-related certification&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;## Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Competitive salary based on experience&lt;br&gt;- Health, dental, and vision insurance&lt;br&gt;- 401(k) with company match&lt;br&gt;- Flexible PTO&lt;br&gt;- Remote/hybrid work options&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Job Title: Technical Program Manager (TPM) – Tech &amp;amp; Software&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; [Remote / Hybrid / On-site - City, State]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Job Type:&lt;/strong&gt; [Full-Time / Part-Time / Contract]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience Level:&lt;/strong&gt; [Mid-Level / Senior / 5+ Years]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt; Product &amp;amp; Engineering / Program Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;We are seeking a proactive and strategic &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;41&quot;&gt;Technical Program Manager (TPM)&lt;/strong&gt; to drive complex, cross-functional engineering initiatives from inception through delivery. In this role, you will sit at the intersection of product strategy, engineering execution, and business goals. You will partner closely with engineering leads, product managers, design, and executive leadership to align technical roadmaps, mitigate risks, and streamline delivery processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;If you thrive on turning ambiguity into structured execution, unblocking high-performing technical teams, and optimizing software delivery workflows, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Program Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Scope, plan, and manage complex end-to-end technical programs, aligning engineering schedules with product roadmaps and strategic business goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary bridge between engineering, product management, design, QA, and business stakeholders to keep teams aligned on scope, milestones, and dependencies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Issue Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify technical bottlenecks, architectural risks, and resource constraints, developing mitigation strategies before they impact timelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Process Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Refine agile delivery frameworks (Scrum, Kanban) and establish lightweight metrics (e.g., velocity, cycle time, defect density) to continuously improve team efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate complex technical challenges, architecture decisions, and project statuses into clear, actionable updates for executive leadership and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Resource &amp;amp; Capacity Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with engineering leads to evaluate bandwidth, prioritize feature backlog items, and assign resources effectively across concurrent streams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;Required Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; [5+] years of program or project management experience within a fast-paced software, SaaS, or tech environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience as a software engineer, technical architect, or engineering manager—or equivalent hands-on experience navigating complex technical architecture, APIs, and cloud systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Methodologies &amp;amp; Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastery of Agile/Scrum methodologies and deep proficiency with project tracking platforms (Jira, Confluence, Linear, Asana).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Dependency &amp;amp; Risk Tracking:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated track record of managing multi-team dependencies, release cycles, and technical debt tradeoffs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional verbal and written communication skills with a proven ability to lead without direct authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;Preferred / Nice-to-Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot;&gt;PMP, CSM (Certified ScrumMaster), or PMI-ACP certification.&lt;/p&gt;
