&lt;p&gt;Job Summary&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a skilled and creative Toymaker to join our team! In this role, you will be responsible for designing, crafting, and refining toys that spark imagination, joy, and engagement for children of all ages. The ideal candidate should possess hands-on craftsmanship skills, an eye for detail, and a passion for creating high-quality, safe, and innovative toys. You will work closely with a team of designers, product developers, and quality assurance professionals to bring exciting new products to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Design and create prototypes for new toy concepts based on market trends, user feedback, and brand standards.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Develop and refine toy models using a variety of materials, including wood, fabric, plastic, and digital design software.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Work closely with the design and development teams to ensure that toys meet safety, durability, and aesthetic standards.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Conduct product testing to ensure toys are safe, functional, and engaging.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Collaborate on continuous improvement of product design and manufacturing processes.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Provide accurate cost and time estimates for production of prototypes and final products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skills and Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience in Toy Design: Minimum of 3-5 years in toy design or a related field, with a portfolio showcasing previous work.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Craftsmanship Skills: Skilled in handling materials like wood, fabric, and plastic; proficiency with tools and machinery relevant to toy manufacturing.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Technical Skills: Familiarity with CAD or similar software for digital toy design and prototyping.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Creativity and Innovation: A strong sense of creativity to design toys that are unique, imaginative, and appealing to children and parents alike.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Knowledge of Safety Standards: Familiarity with child safety standards and regulations, including ASTM F963, EN 71, or equivalent.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Attention to Detail: Precision in measuring, cutting, assembling, and finishing products.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Problem-Solving Skills: Ability to troubleshoot issues in the design and production stages, ensuring high-quality output.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Team Collaboration: Strong communication skills to work effectively with designers, engineers, and other team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Degree or certification in Industrial Design, Art, or related field.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience with sustainable or eco-friendly materials.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Understanding of manufacturing processes, from small batch production to large-scale manufacturing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Opportunity to bring joy to children through creativity and craftsmanship.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Collaborative and inspiring work environment.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Room for growth and professional development within the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Application Process:&lt;br&gt;Interested candidates are invited to submit their resume, portfolio, and a cover letter explaining their passion for toymaking and why they would be a great fit for our team.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Job Summary AAAA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a skilled and creative Toymaker to join our team! In this role, you will be responsible for designing, crafting, and refining toys that spark imagination, joy, and engagement for children of all ages. The ideal candidate should possess hands-on craftsmanship skills, an eye for detail, and a passion for creating high-quality, safe, and innovative toys. You will work closely with a team of designers, product developers, and quality assurance professionals to bring exciting new products to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Design and create prototypes for new toy concepts based on market trends, user feedback, and brand standards.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Develop and refine toy models using a variety of materials, including wood, fabric, plastic, and digital design software.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Work closely with the design and development teams to ensure that toys meet safety, durability, and aesthetic standards.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Conduct product testing to ensure toys are safe, functional, and engaging.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Collaborate on continuous improvement of product design and manufacturing processes.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Provide accurate cost and time estimates for production of prototypes and final products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skills and Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience in Toy Design: Minimum of 3-5 years in toy design or a related field, with a portfolio showcasing previous work.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Craftsmanship Skills: Skilled in handling materials like wood, fabric, and plastic; proficiency with tools and machinery relevant to toy manufacturing.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Technical Skills: Familiarity with CAD or similar software for digital toy design and prototyping.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Creativity and Innovation: A strong sense of creativity to design toys that are unique, imaginative, and appealing to children and parents alike.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Knowledge of Safety Standards: Familiarity with child safety standards and regulations, including ASTM F963, EN 71, or equivalent.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Attention to Detail: Precision in measuring, cutting, assembling, and finishing products.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Problem-Solving Skills: Ability to troubleshoot issues in the design and production stages, ensuring high-quality output.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Team Collaboration: Strong communication skills to work effectively with designers, engineers, and other team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Degree or certification in Industrial Design, Art, or related field.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience with sustainable or eco-friendly materials.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Understanding of manufacturing processes, from small batch production to large-scale manufacturing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Opportunity to bring joy to children through creativity and craftsmanship.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Collaborative and inspiring work environment.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Room for growth and professional development within the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Application Process:&lt;br&gt;Interested candidates are invited to submit their resume, portfolio, and a cover letter explaining their passion for toymaking and why they would be a great fit for our team.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Here is a modern, customizable job description template for a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;62&quot;&gt;UI/UX Designer&lt;/strong&gt;. You can easily adapt the design software requirements, team structure, and industry specifics to fit your hiring needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Job Title: UI/UX Designer&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; [Remote / Hybrid / On-site - City, State]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Job Type:&lt;/strong&gt; [Full-Time / Part-Time / Contract]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience Level:&lt;/strong&gt; [Mid-Level / 3+ Years]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt; Product &amp;amp; Design&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;We are seeking a creative, user-centric &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;40&quot;&gt;UI/UX Designer&lt;/strong&gt; to craft intuitive, engaging, and accessible digital experiences across our web and mobile applications. In this role, you will be involved in every stage of the product design process—from conducting user research and mapping out wireframes to building interactive prototypes and delivering polished visual UI systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;You will collaborate closely with product managers, frontend engineers, and user researchers to translate complex user needs and business objectives into seamless, beautiful, and functional software interfaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;User Experience (UX) &amp;amp; Research&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;User Research &amp;amp; Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct qualitative and quantitative user research, user interviews, and usability testing to validate design concepts and uncover user friction points.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Information Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Create user flows, wireframes, site maps, and customer journey maps to define smooth interaction patterns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate complex workflows into simple, intuitive UI solutions that balance user needs with technical feasibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;User Interface (UI) &amp;amp; Visual Design&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Interface Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Craft visually stunning, high-fidelity UI layouts and interactive components for desktop, web, and mobile platforms (iOS/Android).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Design Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain, scale, and contribute to our visual design system, UI component libraries, and style guides to ensure consistency across all products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Prototyping:&lt;/strong&gt; Build interactive, animated prototypes in Figma or ProtoPie to demonstrate motion, micro-interactions, and user flows to stakeholders and engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Engineering Handoff:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with frontend developers to ensure accurate implementation of designs, conducting QA reviews on built UI components.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Design Iteration:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively participate in design critiques, iterating based on team feedback, user analytics, and business KPIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;Required Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; [3+] years of professional UI/UX design experience working on web or mobile software applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Portfolio:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong design portfolio demonstrating end-to-end UI/UX process, including user research, wireframing, high-fidelity visual design, and interactive prototypes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Design Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastery of industry-standard design and prototyping tools (&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;73&quot;&gt;Figma&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;80&quot;&gt;Sketch&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;91&quot;&gt;Adobe XD&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Responsive Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of responsive layout principles, grid systems, mobile-first design, and accessibility standards (WCAG guidelines).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent presentation and storytelling skills to articulate design decisions to cross-functional teams and stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;Preferred / Nice-to-Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;23&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23,0,0&quot;&gt;Basic knowledge of HTML, CSS, and frontend frameworks (e.g., React, Tailwind) to better collaborate with engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23,1,0&quot;&gt;Experience using design system management tools like &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;53&quot;&gt;Storybook&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;66&quot;&gt;Zeroheight&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23,2,0&quot;&gt;Background in interaction design, motion graphic design, or micro-animation (e.g., Lottie, Principle, After Effects).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23,3,0&quot;&gt;Familiarity with product analytics tools (&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;42&quot;&gt;Mixpanel&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;52&quot;&gt;FullStory&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;63&quot;&gt;Hotjar&lt;/strong&gt;) to inform design iterations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
